// LLAMP-SPEC v1 | ADR-027
=adr: 027
=title: Losant-Style Mapping UI for action:writeDeviceState
=date: 2026-02-24
=status: accepted

#ctx
~problem: action:writeDeviceState node config panel had raw JSON textarea for mappings field
~user_pain: hand-write [{key:"...",expression:"..."}] JSON — error-prone
~reference: Losant uses individual-field rows per mapping

#decision
=chosen: replace textarea with mapping-list field type
=ui: Attribute/Expression column grid + per-row ✕ remove + "+ Add Mapping" dashed button
=autocomplete: Attribute column wired to deviceAttributes datalist
=state: mappingRows: MappingRow[] local to NodeConfigPanel; synced via handleFieldChange to formData.config.mappings
=reset_effect: keyed on selectedNode?.id to handle node switching
!no_backend_changes: backend already expects config.mappings:[{key,expression}]

#consequences
+pos: [better_UX_no_raw_JSON, consistent_with_backend, autocomplete_from_deviceAttributes]
-neg: [adds_mapping-list_to_FieldConfig.type_union]
~reuse: deviceAttributes datalist already computed for device-field type

#scope
=arch_summary_update: no
